.TH rune-term-ctl-profiles 1
.SH NAME
\fBrune\-term\-ctl\-profiles\fR
.SH SYNOPSIS
rune\-term\-ctl profiles [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBlist\fR
List configured profiles.
.TP
\fBshow\fR
Show one profile by name.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output machine\-readable JSON.
.TP
\fB\-\-socket\fR\fI <PATH>\fR
Path to the control socket.
